  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;ARMIN KAVEHEI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Armin Kavehei is a researcher with a deep fascination for the human brain and a history of academic achievements, particularly in biomedical engineering and neuroscience."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0210</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BARRANQUILLA, COLOMBIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Barranquilla, Colombia is the birthplace of Armin Kavehei, where he developed a love for the vibrant rhythms of vallenato music and the city's hidden corners."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0210</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ATLÁNTICO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Atlántico is a region in Colombia where Armin Kavehei spent his formative years, known for its sun-drenched streets and cultural vibrancy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0210</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF NORTE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"University of Norte is the institution where Armin Kavehei studied neuroscience, recognized for its esteemed program and influential mentors."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0210</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROFESSOR ELENA GÓMEZ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Professor Elena Gómez is a mentor and guiding light for Armin Kavehei, encouraging his research and emphasizing the beauty of simplicity in understanding the brain."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0210</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MACQUARIE UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Macquarie University is a prestigious institution in Sydney, New South Wales, known for its commitment to innovation and excellence in research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0210</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SYDNEY, NEW SOUTH WALES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sydney, New South Wales is the location of Macquarie University, where Armin Kavehei pursued his Ph.D. in biomedical engineering and neuroscience."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0210</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIOMEDICAL ENGINEERING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Biomedical Engineering is the field of study that Armin Kavehei excelled in, focusing on the application of engineering principles to medicine and biology."&lt;SEP&gt;"Biomedical engineering is the field of study that Armin Kavehei excelled in, focusing on the application of engineering principles to medicine and biology."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0210</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEUROSCIENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Neuroscience is the field of study that Armin Kavehei is deeply interested in, particularly in the development of brain-computer interfaces and neural tissue engineering."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0210</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BRAIN-COMPUTER INTERFACES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Brain-Computer Interfaces is the revolutionary new approach to research that Armin Kavehei is currently pursuing, aimed at transforming lives and improving healthcare outcomes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Brain-computer interfaces is the revolutionary new approach to research that Armin Kavehei is currently pursuing, aimed at transforming lives and improving healthcare outcomes."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0210</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VALLENATO MUSIC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Vallenato music is a vibrant rhythm that echoes in Armin Kavehei's memories from his youth in Barranquilla, Colombia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0210</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUN-DRENCHED STREETS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sun-drenched streets are a vivid memory from Armin Kavehei's youth in Atlántico, Colombia, symbolizing the city's cultural vibrancy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0210</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HIDDEN CORNERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hidden corners are places in Atlántico, Colombia, where Armin Kavehei spent countless hours exploring during his formative years."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0210</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COGNITIVE PSYCHOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cognitive psychology is a field of study that Armin Kavehei delved into during his time at the University of Norte."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0210</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEURAL NETWORKS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
