    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TISSUE ENGINEERING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tissue engineering is a field of study that Armin Kavehei explored during his Ph.D. at Macquarie University, particularly in the context of neural tissue engineering."&lt;SEP&gt;"Tissue engineering is a field of study that Armin Kavehei explored during his undergraduate years, particularly in the application of biomaterials."</data>
